Z||000001||FieroJoe||06-18-2001||09:57 PM||||What black molding are you trying to remove?<P>The easiest way to get the big piece off the doors is take off the inner door panel, and push the little clips through.<P>The moldings that are on the fascia dont actually come off, if you were trying to remove those.<P>The marker lights are pretty self explanitory.<P>The other rear quarter panel trim is held on by the same type of clip fasteners that holds on the door trim.  There is also sometimes a screw in the inner fender well that holds on this piece too.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
